---
description: Protobuf / gRPC stubs — edit swarm.proto only, regenerate via python -m swarm_sdk.pb
globs: src/swarm_sdk/pb/**,**/swarm.proto
alwaysApply: false
---

# Protobuf / gRPC

- Source of truth: `src/swarm_sdk/pb/swarm.proto`.
- Generated `swarm_pb2*` — **do not hand-edit**.
- Regenerate: `uv run python -m swarm_sdk.pb` (custom package-path `-Iswarm_sdk/pb=…`).
- Imports: `from swarm_sdk.pb import swarm_pb2, swarm_pb2_grpc`.
- **After editing** `.proto` or regenerators, Context7-check gRPC Python (`/websites/grpc_io` or `/grpc/grpc.io`), then tighten.
